@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Signal Passage extension discovery
+
+Signal Passage keeps its objective, colors, content, scenarios, and behavior in the consumer workspace. M025 adds reusable bounded geometry and offline WAV synthesis, but does not claim a stable extension API.
+
+The current friction is duplicated generated-sound linkage and a lack of consumer geometry preview diagnostics. Those are the only justified M026 candidates. A generic objective or plugin API remains speculative.
